### 1. CREATE - Tạo đơn hàng 1
POST http://localhost:8082/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": "ORD-001",
  "totalPrice": 999.00,
  "status": "PENDING"
}

### 2. CREATE - Tạo đơn hàng 2
POST http://localhost:8082/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": "ORD-002",
  "totalPrice": 1999.00,
  "status": "CONFIRMED"
}

### 3. CREATE - Tạo đơn hàng 3
POST http://localhost:8082/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": "ORD-003",
  "totalPrice": 249.00,
  "status": "SHIPPED"
}


### 4. READ - Lấy danh sách tất cả đơn hàng
GET http://localhost:8082/api/orders


### 5. READ - Lấy chi tiết đơn hàng theo ID (giả sử ID = 1)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/orders/1


### 6. UPDATE - Cập nhật đơn hàng có ID = 1
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/orders/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": "ORD-001-UPDATED",
  "totalPrice": 1199.00,
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}


### 7. DELETE - Xóa đơn hàng có ID = 3
DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/orders/3



docker build -t your-dockerhub-username/order-service:latest .
docker push your-dockerhub-username/order-service:latest